     A**
     A                                      REF(FSREFP)
     A          R PAN01                     TEXT('PBills Analysis File')
     A            ANCLT#    R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A                                      COLHDG('Client Number')
     A            ANFRDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('From Date')
     A            ANTODT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('To Date')
     A            ANAST     R               REFFLD(ST)
     A                                      COLHDG('Adjudication State')
     A            ANBTYP    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('Bill Type')
     A*           Valid values: P - Physician (HCFA)
     A*                         H - Hospital (UB)
     A*                         X - Pharmacy
     A*                         D - Dental
     A*
     A            ANTYPE    R               REFFLD(CODE)
     A                                      COLHDG('Amount Type')
     A*           Valid values: B  - Bill Count
     A*                         C  - Charge
     A*                         M  - MRA reductions (savings)
     A*                         O1 - Other 1 reductions (savings)
     A*                         O2 - Other 2 reductions (savings)
     A*                         N  - Network reductions (savings)
     A*                         P  - Paid
     A*
     A            ANTYCD    R               REFFLD(DS10)
     A                                      COLHDG('Type Code')
     A*           Valid values: Other 1 Reductions type code
     A*                         Other 2 Reductions type code
     A*                         Network master code
     A*
     A*           Note: This will be left blank for Charge, MRA or Paid
     A*
     A            ANBCNT    R               REFFLD(CNT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Bill Count')
     A            ANAAMT    R               REFFLD(A112)
     A                                      COLHDG('Average Amount')
     A            ANTAMT    R               REFFLD(A112)
     A                                      COLHDG('Total Amount')
